                <head>No. 118.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 27, 1872</date>.
                        (Received at 3.45 p.m.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>British argument tiled. Arbitration goes on.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
